WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.521 --> 00:00:04.688
- [Woman] It is 1999 and I
am attending a residential

00:00:05.587 --> 00:00:09.380
high school, there's girls'
dorms, there's the guys',

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.250
and the hormones are real.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:15.314
There was a guy, we were both students,

00:00:15.314 --> 00:00:18.524
we started hanging out,
along comes November,

00:00:18.524 --> 00:00:21.626
we start making out,
but then December comes,

00:00:21.626 --> 00:00:25.257
and there's like a week left
of school before Christmas

00:00:25.257 --> 00:00:28.117
break and keep in mind, this is 1999.

00:00:28.117 --> 00:00:29.617
Y2K is everywhere.

00:00:31.094 --> 00:00:33.118
- [Reporter] When the
ball drops New Year's Eve,

00:00:33.118 --> 00:00:35.231
everyone is preparing for the world.

00:00:35.231 --> 00:00:36.486
- [Reporter] Computers gone haywire

00:00:36.486 --> 00:00:39.332
could mean shortages of
food, water, and electricity.

00:00:39.332 --> 00:00:40.884
- [Reporter] They're prepared to survive

00:00:40.884 --> 00:00:41.989
no matter what happens.

00:00:41.989 --> 00:00:43.969
- [Reporter] The end of
the world could be soon.

00:00:43.969 --> 00:00:47.229
- [Woman] I seriously believed it.

00:00:47.229 --> 00:00:50.757
Bombs going off from all the
hidden silos in the world.

00:00:50.757 --> 00:00:52.804
- [Reporter] Security
officials are believed to be

00:00:52.804 --> 00:00:54.614
on the biggest alert since World War II.

00:00:54.614 --> 00:00:56.997
- [Woman] At that time, you
didn't really fact check,

00:00:56.997 --> 00:00:58.151
you just believed.

00:00:58.151 --> 00:01:02.358
With that came a fear I
could possibly die a virgin.

00:01:02.358 --> 00:01:03.699
- They're making too much out of it,

00:01:03.699 --> 00:01:05.441
it's not gonna be anything.

00:01:05.441 --> 00:01:07.580
- [Woman] In study hall one
night, I actually sent him

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:10.172
an email that was like, you
know I was thinking about this

00:01:10.172 --> 00:01:14.339
and we have a week left before
we have to go home for break

00:01:15.329 --> 00:01:17.716
and maybe we should, you know,

00:01:17.716 --> 00:01:20.004
take care of it before, you know.

00:01:20.004 --> 00:01:22.344
(explodes)
The world ends.

00:01:22.344 --> 00:01:26.594
Kinda sarcastic, kinda not, but
he said okay, let's do this.

00:01:26.594 --> 00:01:29.779
Some of our favorite makeout spots

00:01:29.779 --> 00:01:32.870
were these low bushes near the library.

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:34.740
Let's see, oh there was a graveyard.

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.804
(laughs)
It was pure teenage horniness.

00:01:37.804 --> 00:01:39.251
I mean, it could have been Fort Knox

00:01:39.251 --> 00:01:43.883
but there's horny kids and
they're away from their parents,

00:01:43.883 --> 00:01:45.606
it's going to happen.

00:01:45.606 --> 00:01:49.307
We escaped the dorms
and we found this tree,

00:01:49.307 --> 00:01:53.080
had some awkward petting,
looking around, darting around,

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:55.030
making sure no one's looking,

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.300
'cause this is the late
'90s, everything was N'SYNC

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:02.187
and Backstreet Boys, so you
expected to have him show up

00:02:02.187 --> 00:02:05.306
with a rose and there to
be this earth-shattering

00:02:05.306 --> 00:02:08.639
kind of experience and then it happened.

00:02:10.706 --> 00:02:13.480
It wasn't great and it wasn't bad

00:02:13.480 --> 00:02:17.202
but there were the sensation
of having tree roots

00:02:17.202 --> 00:02:19.436
and branches pressed against your butt

00:02:19.436 --> 00:02:21.269
isn't exactly romantic

00:02:22.542 --> 00:02:25.625
and like kinda laid there in silence.

00:02:27.359 --> 00:02:28.932
That was it.

00:02:28.932 --> 00:02:31.791
Went home for Christmas
break, more people watched

00:02:31.791 --> 00:02:35.120
that countdown than ever,
everyone young and old was like,

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:36.952
oh, are we about to die?

00:02:36.952 --> 00:02:40.197
But everything worked
out, we're still alive.

00:02:40.197 --> 00:02:44.032
And I continued our
relationship in earnest.

00:02:44.032 --> 00:02:47.962
There's not gonna be this huge explosion

00:02:47.962 --> 00:02:50.730
and everyone will know about it,

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:55.198
don't put too much
pressure on it happening,

00:02:55.198 --> 00:02:59.365
make sure you're ready, make
sure you want it, go for it.

00:03:00.579 --> 00:03:03.246
